# The v0 workspace: the Rust toolchain from the dotfiles `rust` profile (which
# extends `systems`: samply, tracy, bloaty, llvm...), and the locally built v0 on
# PATH. This replaces `cargo install`, which the machine policy forbids for
# anything transient -- a binary in ~/.cargo/bin outlives the checkout it came
# from and silently goes stale.
use flake ~/dev/dotfiles#rust
PATH_add v0/target/release
